  "name": "Spanreed · Door Ajar palette",
  "note": "Family hexes = round-1 starting palette, unchanged, so the Door Ajar and Lamplight kits stay one family. Family hexes, names, keys and order, and every RGB / CMYK / Lab / Pantone number of a family colour, come from kit/shared/palette/spanreed_palette.py (shared by Door Ajar and Lamplight). CMYK is a naive device conversion (K = 1 − max(R,G,B); C = (1−R−K)/(1−K), …) with no ICC profile: for print, convert from sRGB in a colour-managed app with the printer's profile (e.g. PSO Coated v3 / GRACoL 2013) and proof. Pantone matches are the nearest CIEDE2000 hit in the shared table of approximate sRGB previews (kit/shared/palette/pantone_approx.py), not an official Pantone library: verify every one against a physical Pantone Formula Guide (Solid Coated) before print.",
